      <section><h3>진행이력</h3><div class="major-history-list">${t.progress_updates.length?t.progress_updates.map(p=>`<article class="major-history-item"><strong>${fmt(p.update_date)} · ${esc(p.author_name||'작성자')}</strong><p>${esc(p.progress_text)}</p>${p.result_text?`<small>결과: ${esc(p.result_text)}</small>`:''}${p.risk_text?`<small class="table-sub">이슈: ${esc(p.risk_text)}</small>`:''}${p.next_action?`<small class="table-sub">다음: ${esc(p.next_action)} · ${fmt(p.next_action_date)}</small>`:''}<div class="major-task-badges">${p.applied_stage_id?chip('Stage 변경'):''}${p.applied_rag?chip(`진행위험도 ${riskLabels[p.applied_rag]}`):''}${p.state_changes?.ball?chip('Ball 변경'):''}</div>${p.decision_needed?`<span class="major-chip warning">의사결정 ${esc(p.decision_needed)}</span>`:''}${p.permissions?.revise?`<button class="mini-btn" data-major-action="progress-revise" data-task-id="${t.id}" data-parent-id="${p.id}">수정이력 남기기</button>`:''}</article>`).join(''):'<div class="empty-state">누적 진행이력이 없습니다.</div>'}</div>${t.progress_revisions?.length?`<details class="major-revision-history"><summary>수정 전 진행기록 ${num(t.progress_revisions.length)}건 펼쳐보기</summary>${t.progress_revisions.map(p=>`<article><strong>${fmt(p.update_date)} · ${esc(p.author_name||'작성자')}</strong><p>${esc(p.progress_text)}</p><small>수정 사유: ${esc(p.revision_reason||'—')} · 기록시각 ${fmt(p.created_at)}</small></article>`).join('')}</details>`:''}</section>
